    "title": "RIU Hotels & Resorts",
    "description": "The new RIU app is full of benefits for you! Download it and keep it by your side throughout your holidays.\r\n\r\nWhat can you do?\r\n\r\n- Book your holidays in an easy, secure and convenient way at the Lowest Price Guaranteed\r\n- Check the details of your booking\r\n- Access your Riu Class account. Not a member yet? You can register and start making the most of all the benefits!\r\n- Check in online to avoid queues when you arrive\r\n- FInd out about the services and facilities available at your hotel\r\n- Book tables at most of our restaurants and spa treatments, request room cleaning or minibar refills.....\r\n- Notify the hotel of any incident that comes up during your stay\r\nStart enjoying your RIU experience now! And if you like, you can let us know what you think of the new app. We would love to hear your comments so we can carry on making it better each day.\r\n\r\nIf you have any problems, please contact us via webmaster@riu.com.\r\n\r\nVisit us on www.riu.com\r\n\r\nFOLLOW US:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Facebook: /Riuhoteles\r\n\u2022 Instagram: /riuhotels\r\n\u2022 Twitter: @RiuHoteles\r\n\u2022 YouTube (ingles): RiuHotelsandResorts\r\n\u2022 Pinterest: /riuhotel",
    "descriptionHTML": "The new RIU app is full of benefits for you! Download it and keep it by your side throughout your holidays.<br><br>What can you do?<br><br>- Book your holidays in an easy, secure and convenient way at the Lowest Price Guaranteed<br>- Check the details of your booking<br>- Access your Riu Class account. Not a member yet? You can register and start making the most of all the benefits!<br>- Check in online to avoid queues when you arrive<br>- FInd out about the services and facilities available at your hotel<br>- Book tables at most of our restaurants and spa treatments, request room cleaning or minibar refills.....<br>- Notify the hotel of any incident that comes up during your stay<br>Start enjoying your RIU experience now! And if you like, you can let us know what you think of the new app. We would love to hear your comments so we can carry on making it better each day.<br><br>If you have any problems, please contact us via webmaster@riu.com.<br><br>Visit us on www.riu.com<br><br>FOLLOW US:<br><br>\u2022 Facebook: /Riuhoteles<br>\u2022 Instagram: /riuhotels<br>\u2022 Twitter: @RiuHoteles<br>\u2022 YouTube (ingles): RiuHotelsandResorts<br>\u2022 Pinterest: /riuhotel",
